<title>USA: Depositions set on Conrail proposal - source.</title>
<headline>Depositions set on Conrail proposal - source.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Depositions of key officials involved in Conrail Inc's proposed merger with CSX Corp will be taken in a lawsuit by Norfolk Southern Corp seeking to block the merger, a legal source close to the case said.</p>
<p>A schedule and roster for the depositions has yet to be agreed, the source told Reuters.</p>
<p>&quot;There will be depositions taken,&quot; the source said. &quot;The exact discovery that will be undertaken and the exact identity of the individuals have not been identified yet,&quot; he said.</p>
</text>
